  ---  Complete Hardware Categories — Sri Lanka Reference List
  ---
  🔩 1. Fasteners & Fixings

  Nuts, bolts, screws, washers, anchor bolts, rawl plugs, rivets, nails, pins, and all threaded fasteners. The highest variety category in
  any hardware shop — available in dozens of sizes and materials (GI, stainless steel, brass).

  ---
  🪛  2. Hand Tools

  Hammers, screwdrivers, spanners, pliers, wrenches, chisels, files, hacksaws, tape measures, spirit levels, mallets, tin snips, utility
  knives, and all non-powered hand tools.

  ---
  ⚡ 3. Power Tools

  Electric drills, angle grinders, circular saws, jigsaws, sanders, impact drivers, rotary hammers, heat guns, and cordless tool sets.
  Includes tool accessories such as drill bits, grinding discs, and saw blades.

  ---
  🔌 4. Electrical — Wiring & Cables

  PVC wiring cables, flexible cords, armoured cables, earth cables, telephone cables, CCTV cables, speaker cables. Available in various core  sizes (1.5mm, 2.5mm, 4mm, 6mm, etc.).

  ---
  🔧 5. Electrical — Switches, Sockets & Accessories

  Wall switches, socket outlets, 3-pin plugs, extension boards, junction boxes, conduit boxes, cable clips, cable ties, electrical tape, and  surface/concealed wiring accessories.

  ---
  ⚙️  6. Electrical — Circuit Protection (MCB / RCCB)

  Miniature Circuit Breakers (MCBs), RCCBs, distribution boards (DB boxes), fuse holders, fuse wire, surge protectors, and consumer unit
  components. High-demand in construction projects.

  ---
  💡 7. Lighting & Fixtures

  LED bulbs, tube lights, down lights, floodlights, street lights, batten fittings, panel lights, emergency lights, light switches, dimmer
  switches, and lamp holders. Growing category with LED replacing fluorescent.

  ---
  🚿 8. Pipes — PVC & uPVC

  PVC pressure pipes, uPVC drainage pipes, column pipes, conduit pipes, and related fittings — couplings, elbows, tees, reducers, end caps.
  Sold by metre or in lengths. Very high volume in Sri Lanka construction.

  ---
  🔗 9. Pipes — GI & Steel

  Galvanized iron (GI) pipes, black iron pipes, square tubes, rectangular hollow sections, round pipes — used for structural, railing, and
  plumbing applications. Sold by length or cut to size.

  ---
  🪠  10. Plumbing Fittings — Brass & CP

  Brass gate valves, ball valves, check valves, globe valves, bib taps, pillar taps, wall mixers, shower heads, pipe unions, nipples, and
  bushings. Chrome plated (CP) items for visible plumbing fixtures.

  ---
  🚰 11. Sanitary Fittings & Accessories

  Wash basin traps, floor traps, toilet flush systems, concealed cisterns, bathroom accessories (towel rails, soap dishes, toilet paper
  holders), shower enclosure hardware, and waste fittings.

  ---
  🏗️  12. Structural Steel & Metal Products

  MS flat bars, angle iron, channel sections, I-beams, chequered plates, GI sheets, corrugated sheets, steel rods (re-bars), and binding
  wire. Used for construction and fabrication.

  ---
  🪟  13. Roofing Materials & Accessories

  GI corrugated sheets, Zincalume/Colorbond roofing sheets, ridge caps, J-hooks, roofing screws with washers, roof gutters, downpipes, and
  rainwater fittings.

  ---
  🚪 14. Doors, Windows & Ironmongery

  Door hinges, door handles, door closers, floor springs, tower bolts, barrel bolts, door viewers (peepholes), window stays, casement
  fasteners, sliding door tracks, and door frames hardware.

  ---
  🔐 15. Locks & Security Hardware

  Padlocks, mortice locks, cylinder rim locks, deadbolts, door chains, hasps & staples, cabinet locks, combination locks, and master key
  systems. High-demand in both residential and commercial.

  ---
  🪣  16. Paint & Surface Coatings

  Interior emulsion paints, exterior weather shield paints, enamel paints, primers, undercoats, varnishes, wood stains, anti-rust paints,
  epoxy coatings, and waterproofing compounds.

  ---
  🖌️  17. Paint Tools & Accessories

  Paint brushes, rollers, roller trays, masking tape, painter's plastic sheets, paint strainers, putty knives, scraper tools, sandpaper, and  spray painting equipment.

  ---
  🧱 18. Cement, Concrete & Masonry

  Portland cement (sold by bag), ready-mix products, tile adhesive, tile grout, epoxy grout, cement additives, waterproofing admixtures, and  concrete bonding agents.

  ---
  🪴  19. Adhesives, Sealants & Fillers

  Epoxy adhesives, contact cement (Dunlop-type), super glue, PVC solvent cement, silicone sealant, polyurethane sealant, acrylic sealant,
  wall filler (putty), expanding foam, and wood glue.

  ---
  🛡️  20. Abrasives & Cutting Consumables

  Grinding discs, cutting discs, flap discs, wire brushes, emery cloth, sandpaper sheets/rolls, abrasive blocks, diamond blades, and TCT
  blades. High-turnover consumables.

  ---
  🪜  21. Ladders & Access Equipment

  Aluminium step ladders, extension ladders, platform stepladders, scaffold boards, trestle platforms, and safety barriers for construction
  use.

  ---
  🦺 22. Safety & PPE Equipment

  Safety helmets, safety boots, safety gloves, safety spectacles, dust masks, ear muffs, high-visibility vests, safety harnesses, face
  shields, and first aid kits.

  ---
  🔥 23. Welding & Gas Equipment

  Welding rods (electrodes), welding wire (MIG/TIG), welding helmets, welding gloves, gas regulators, gas hoses, oxygen and acetylene
  fittings, and welding clamps.

  ---
  💧 24. Pumps & Motors

  Submersible pumps, jet pumps, centrifugal pumps, booster pumps, sewage pumps, electric motors, and related fittings — pressure tanks,
  pressure switches, foot valves. Very common in Sri Lanka (water supply issues).

  ---
  🧰 25. Toolbox & Storage

  Tool boxes, tool bags, wall-mounted tool racks, storage cabinets, parts organizer boxes, and plastic bins for small item storage.

  ---
  🌿 26. Garden & Outdoor Hardware

  Garden hoses, hose fittings, sprinkler heads, hose reels, garden taps, outdoor taps, irrigation fittings, wheelbarrows, and outdoor post
  fittings.

  ---
  🚗 27. Automotive Hardware

  Automotive bolts and fasteners, hose clamps, battery terminals, automotive wire, cable lugs, heat shrink tubing, zip ties, and workshop
  consumables.

  ---
  🪵  28. Timber & Wood Products

  Treated timber planks, plywood sheets, MDF boards, hardboard, chipboard, timber mouldings, and wood dowels. Sizes vary from 3mm plywood to  structural timber.

  ---
  🏠 29. Insulation Materials

  Rock wool insulation, glass wool, foam insulation sheets, pipe lagging, reflective foil insulation, and acoustic insulation boards.

  ---
  🧯 30. Fire Safety Equipment

  Fire extinguishers (CO2, dry powder, foam), fire hose reels, smoke detectors, fire alarm panels, fire blankets, and emergency exit signs.

  ---
  ⚙️  31. Bearings, Belts & Mechanical Parts

  Ball bearings, roller bearings, V-belts, timing belts, pulleys, sprockets, chains, and shaft couplings. Used by workshops, factories, and
  agricultural equipment repair shops.

  ---
  🧲 32. Magnets, Springs & Miscellaneous Hardware

  Compression springs, extension springs, torsion springs, rare earth magnets, rubber stops, rubber grommets, O-rings, and assorted workshop  hardware.

  ---
  🖥️  33. CCTV & Security Systems (Growing category)

  IP cameras, AHD cameras, DVRs, NVRs, CCTV cables (RG59, CAT6), power supplies, BNC connectors, and mounting brackets. Very active market
  in Sri Lanka currently.

  ---
  💻 34. Networking & Data Cabling (Electrical shops often stock)

  CAT5e/CAT6 cables, RJ45 connectors, patch panels, cable trays, conduit trunking, and network switches. Increasingly demanded by commercial  construction.

  ---
  🔋 35. Batteries & Power Backup

  Dry cell batteries (AA, AAA, D), lantern batteries, UPS batteries (sealed lead acid), rechargeable batteries, battery chargers, and solar
  charge controllers.